  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 25 October 2018). Our client Madhuri Sethi is a 43-year-old college lecturer who lives at Flat 11D, Peelamedu, Coimbatore 641036 and can be reached on +91 91972 49852 or madhuri.sethi@example.com. The client's PAN HRBPS5201Y.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Pooja Goyal. A cheque for 13.9 lakh rupees issued by Pooja Goyal bounced: the cheque was dishonoured because the signature did not match.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 683146074032 (IFSC HDFC0185770).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 2540/2019 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Coimbatore on 6 January 2019.",
